    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Esports Club</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll assemble and manage your own professional esports team. Recruit players from a vast pool of talent, schedule their training, and help them hone their skills. Immerse yourself in the joy of guiding your team from humble beginnings to dominating the world stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/6481532c4904677c1c6871c0924c2a16.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/6481532c4904677c1c6871c0924c2a16.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/6481532c4904677c1c6871c0924c2a16.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dual Challenge of Strategy and Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing a team isn\u2019t easy. You\u2019ll face relentless challenges: financial struggles, failed investments, coaches resigning, and players leaving... How will you navigate this thorny path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/aa6b291e8dbaf0f1c1ee6a4b357b3c22.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/aa6b291e8dbaf0f1c1ee6a4b357b3c22.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/aa6b291e8dbaf0f1c1ee6a4b357b3c22.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fate's Gifts and Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s not all hardship \u2013 luck may smile upon you with unexpected windfalls, help from friends, romantic confessions, or the favor of investors. Can you hold onto your passion for esports amidst these twists of fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/c605d80098be9ffa5c62807c3ab3e070.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/c605d80098be9ffa5c62807c3ab3e070.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/c605d80098be9ffa5c62807c3ab3e070.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the Fate of Your Team and Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your team claim the championship crown or withdraw in disappointment? Will you live a life of wealth and splendor, or fall into debt and face bankruptcy? Will you find lasting love or lose yourself in fleeting pleasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/e18019000064bd847a802e43c842368f.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/e18019000064bd847a802e43c842368f.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/e18019000064bd847a802e43c842368f.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of your journey depends entirely on your decisions. Where will the wheel of fate stop?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Esports Club</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll assemble and manage your own professional esports team. Recruit players from a vast pool of talent, schedule their training, and help them hone their skills. Immerse yourself in the joy of guiding your team from humble beginnings to dominating the world stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/6481532c4904677c1c6871c0924c2a16.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/6481532c4904677c1c6871c0924c2a16.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/6481532c4904677c1c6871c0924c2a16.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dual Challenge of Strategy and Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing a team isn\u2019t easy. You\u2019ll face relentless challenges: financial struggles, failed investments, coaches resigning, and players leaving... How will you navigate this thorny path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/aa6b291e8dbaf0f1c1ee6a4b357b3c22.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/aa6b291e8dbaf0f1c1ee6a4b357b3c22.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/aa6b291e8dbaf0f1c1ee6a4b357b3c22.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fate's Gifts and Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s not all hardship \u2013 luck may smile upon you with unexpected windfalls, help from friends, romantic confessions, or the favor of investors. Can you hold onto your passion for esports amidst these twists of fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/c605d80098be9ffa5c62807c3ab3e070.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/c605d80098be9ffa5c62807c3ab3e070.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/c605d80098be9ffa5c62807c3ab3e070.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the Fate of Your Team and Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your team claim the championship crown or withdraw in disappointment? Will you live a life of wealth and splendor, or fall into debt and face bankruptcy? Will you find lasting love or lose yourself in fleeting pleasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/e18019000064bd847a802e43c842368f.poster.avif?t=1752029678\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/e18019000064bd847a802e43c842368f.webm?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013150/extras/e18019000064bd847a802e43c842368f.mp4?t=1752029678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of your journey depends entirely on your decisions. Where will the wheel of fate stop?</p>",
    "short_description": "Build and Manage Your Professional Esports Team \u2013 Rise to Glory! Start from scratch and lead your team to the top! Recruit players, devise strategies, and face challenges like financial crises and player departures. Will you achieve championship glory, or find true love?",
